{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken","text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"extendedModule":"OUDSThemesOrange","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B32ThemeIconComponentTokensProviderC38colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape18OUDSTokensSemantic013MultipleColorO5TokenCvp","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: colors.repositoryWarningHigh, dark: colors.opacityTransparentDark)"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcontentstatuswarninginternalshape"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider":{"title":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" used in some components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTag"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllIconComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IconomponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Icons"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider/colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape":{"title":"colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token MultipleColorSemanticToken(light: colors.repositoryWarningHigh, dark: colors.opacityTransparentDark)"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeiconcomponenttokensprovider\/colorcontentstatuswarninginternalshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeIconComponentTokensProvider\/colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"colorContentStatusWarningInternalShape","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MultipleColorSemanticToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@M@OUDSTokensSemantic@objc(cs)MultipleColorSemanticToken"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"icon"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"Theme Orange","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange"},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}]}}}